{"id":"P055-2","subject":"P","unit":"P055","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P055-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n단락비가 작은 기력 발전소의 원통형발전기와 비교하여\n\n단락비가 큰 수차발전기의 특징으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 원통형 발전기에 비해 전압변동률이 크다.\n\n② 원통형 발전기에 비해 전기자반작용이 작다.\n\n③ 원통형 발전기에 비해 동기 임피던스가 작다.\n\n④ 원통형 발전기에 비해 안정도가 크다.\n\n⑤ 원통형 발전기에 비해 극수가 많다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":361},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m26-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1355}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n수용가의 부하가 증가하는 경우, 변압기의 온도상승의 영향\n\n으로 가장 큰 것은?\n\n\n① 철손         ② 동손\n\n③ 유전체손       ④ 와류손\n\n⑤ 히스테리시스손","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":597},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":529}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n어느 변압기의 철손과 전부하동손의 비가 1:2일 때, 변압\n\n기의 효율이 최대라고 한다. 이 때의 부하율은?\n\n\n                           \n①            ②  \n\n                           \n③            ④                             \n\n    \n⑤  ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":620},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m28-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1483}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n권수비가 40인 단상 변압기에서, 1차 저항이 80Ω일 때,\n\n2차 저항Ω은?\n\n\n① 0.0125        ② 0.25\n\n③ 0.025        ④ 0.5\n\n⑤ 0.05","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":399}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n3상 유도전동기의 동기속도가 1500rpm이고, 회전속도가\n\n1455pm일 때, 전동기의 슬립은?\n\n\n① 0.01             ② 0.02\n\n③ 0.025             ④ 0.03\n\n⑤ 0.04","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":620},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":445}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n수차발전소에서 유효낙차가 m일 때, 물의 이론상\n\n분출속도는 몇 ms인가?\n(단, 는 중력가속도ms이다.)\n\n①         ② \n\n   \n③             ④  \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":685},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1008}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\nLNG복합화력발전은 어느 부하를 대비하기 위한 것인가?\n\n\n① 기저부하       ② 일정출력부하\n\n③ 첨두부하       ④ 주파수 조정부하\n\n⑤ 심야부하","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m32-q.webp","width":678,"height":564},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m32-e1.webp","width":678,"height":430}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n전체 출력이 76800W인 태양광 발전 시스템에서 400W\n\n의 모듈을 16개를 직렬로 접속하였다면, 총 병렬모듈의\n\n수는?\n\n\n① 11          ② 12\n\n③ 13          ④ 14\n\n⑤ 15","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":634},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m33-e1.webp","width":696,"height":610}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n송전선용 표준 철탑 설계시 가장 크게 고려해야 할 사항은?\n\n\n① 풍압하중       ② 철탑의 하중\n\n③ 전선의 중량      ④ 빙설하중\n\n⑤ 전선의 인장강도","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m34-e1.webp","width":696,"height":444}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n어떤 교류 발전기의 동기 임피던스가 1.25pu일 때,\n\n발전기의 단락비는?\n\n\n① 2.5          ② 1.25\n\n③ 1           ④ 0.8\n\n⑤ 0.5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m35-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m35-e1.webp","width":696,"height":829}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n3상 동기 발전기의 고장 시에 영상전류  , 정상전류  ,\n\n역상전류 가 같다면, 어떤 고장이 발생한 경우인가?\n\n\n① 1선 지락       ② 2선 지락\n\n③ 선간 단락       ④ 2선 단락\n\n⑤ 3선 단락","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m36-q.webp","width":696,"height":677},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m36-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n중성점 접지의 목적으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 지락고장시 보호계전기의 동작을 확실하게 하기 위함\n\n② 절연내력을 줄이기 위함\n\n③ 전선의 동량을 절약하기 위함\n\n④ 전압강하를 감소시키기 위함\n\n⑤ 전력손실을 감소시키기 위함","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m37-e1.webp","width":696,"height":623}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n송전선로에서 전선을 수직 배치할 때, 오프셋을 하는 목적\n\n은 무엇인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 전선의 진동방지    ② 선간 섬락방지\n\n③ 선로정수의 평형    ④ 상하 단락방지\n\n⑤ 유도장해의 감소","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m38-q.webp","width":678,"height":803},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m38-e1.webp","width":696,"height":648}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n피상전력이 kVA , 역률이 80%인 기기의 역률을 1로\n만들기 위한 콘덴서의 용량은 몇 kVar인가?\n\n\n①     ② \n\n③     ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m39-q.webp","width":678,"height":517},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m39-e1.webp","width":696,"height":612}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P055-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n특성 임피던스가 50Ω인 무손실 선로에 임피던스가\n\n250Ω인 부하가 접속되어 있다. 여기서, 반사계수를\n\n절반으로 하려면 부하의 임피던스는 몇 Ω이 되어야\n\n하는가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 50          ② 75\n\n③ 100         ④ 125\n\n⑤ 150","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 인천교통공사 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e14-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m40-q.webp","width":696,"height":1881},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e14-m40-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
